@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="home-hero p-4 p-md-5 mb-4">
    <h1 class="display-5 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-0">What GamesEdge stores about you, and what it does with it.</p>
</div>

<p class="text-secondary mb-5">Last updated: 26 September 2026</p>

<p class="mb-5">
    GamesEdge only asks for what it needs to run your account. There is no advertising, no profiling and no
    analytics on this site.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
<p class="mb-2">When you register we store:</p>
<ul class="mb-3">
    <li>Your email address, which is also used as your username</li>
    <li>Your first and last name, both of which are optional</li>
    <li>Your password, kept only as a salted hash and never in plain text</li>
    <li>Your account creation date, and whether your account has the Staff or Admin role</li>
</ul>
<p class="mb-5">
    We do not store your IP address, your browser or device details, your phone number or your date of birth.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">How we use it</h2>
<ul class="mb-3">
    <li>Signing you in and keeping you signed in</li>
    <li>Sending your email confirmation link, your welcome email and any password reset link</li>
    <li>Showing administrators which staff accounts exist in the admin area</li>
</ul>
<p class="mb-5">
    We do not use your data for advertising, profiling or marketing, and we do not sell it to anyone.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
<p class="mb-3">This site sets two cookies, and nothing else:</p>
<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-sm align-middle mb-0">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Cookie</th>
                        <th scope="col">What it does</th>
                        <th scope="col">How long it lasts</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="row">.AspNetCore.Identity.Application</th>
                        <td>Keeps you signed in</td>
                        <td>Expires after 5 minutes of inactivity, refreshed each time you use the site</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="row">.AspNetCore.Antiforgery</th>
                        <td>Stops other sites submitting forms on your behalf</td>
                        <td>Ends when you close your browser</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<p class="mb-5">
    There are no advertising or analytics cookies, which is why you will not see a cookie banner on this site.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">Who else sees your data</h2>
<p class="mb-5">
    The stylesheet and icon font are loaded from the jsDelivr CDN, so jsDelivr sees your IP address and browser
    details each time a page loads. Everything else is served by GamesEdge itself. We do not share your account
    details with anyone else.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">How long we keep it</h2>
<p class="mb-5">
    We keep your data for as long as your account exists. If an account is deleted it disappears from the site
    straight away, though the underlying record and any database backups may persist for a short period
    afterwards.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">Your choices</h2>
<p class="mb-2">You can ask us at any time to:</p>
<ul class="mb-3">
    <li>Confirm what we hold about you</li>
    <li>Correct your name or email address</li>
    <li>Delete your account</li>
</ul>
<p class="mb-5">
    There is no self-service delete button yet, so send us an email and we will take care of it for you.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3">Contact</h2>
<p class="mb-5">
    Questions, or a request from the list above? Email
    <a class="link-primary" href="mailto:privacy@gamesedge.com">privacy@gamesedge.com</a>.
</p>

<p class="text-secondary mb-3">
    We will revise the date at the top of this page whenever the policy changes.
</p>
